# Generated eval artifacts — the harness is source-controlled, run outputs are not.
# `results/.gitkeep` keeps the (otherwise-empty) results dir in git. A canonical result can
# still be tracked deliberately after a VALID run, e.g. `git add -f results/latest.md`.
results/*.json
results/latest.md
.eval_clinic.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
